@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Staff Member Assignment

[*] --> Unassigned

state "Unassigned" as Unassigned
state Assigned
state Unemployed
state Archived <<final>>

Unassigned --> Assigned : Assign / assignToClient/campaign
Assigned --> Unassigned : RemoveAssignment / removeFromCampaign/client
Assigned --> Assigned : SwitchAssignment / switchCampaign/client
Assigned --> Unemployed : LeaveJob / markAsUnemployed
Unemployed --> Archived : ArchiveAfterTime

Unassigned --> Unemployed : Resign / markAsUnemployed

@enduml
